# Keep build context small and free of secrets.
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/build
**/coverage
**/.git
**/.gitignore
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example
**/*.pem
**/*.key
**/*.crt
**/logs
**/*.log
**/tmp
**/.cache
**/.turbo
**/.vscode
**/.idea
**/test-results
**/playwright-report
docs/
generated-projects/
.generated/
